\fs96 \cf2 mojo\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa400\partightenfactor0

\fs32 \cf2 The Mojo\uc0\u55357 \u56613  command line interface.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa800\partightenfactor0

\fs64 \cf2 Synopsis\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\fs28 \cf12 \cb13 mojo <command>\cb1 \
\cb13 mojo [run-options] <path>\cb1 \
\cb13 mojo [options]\cb1 \
\cb13 mojo\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0

\fs32 \cf14 \
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0
\cf15 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa800\partightenfactor0

\fs64 \cf2 Description\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0

\fs32 \cf2 The 
\fs28 \cf10 \cb16 mojo
\fs32 \cf2 \cb1  CLI provides all the tools you need for Mojo development, such as commands to run, compile, and package Mojo code. A list of all commands are listed below, and you can learn more about each one by adding the 
\fs28 \cf10 \cb16 --help
\fs32 \cf2 \cb1  option to the command (for example, 
\fs28 \cf10 \cb16 mojo package --help
\fs32 \cf2 \cb1 ).\
However, you may omit the 
\fs28 \cf10 \cb16 run
\fs32 \cf2 \cb1  and 
\fs28 \cf10 \cb16 repl
\fs32 \cf2 \cb1  commands. That is, you can run a Mojo file by simply passing the filename to 
\fs28 \cf10 \cb16 mojo
\fs32 \cf2 \cb1 :\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\fs28 \cf12 \cb13 mojo hello.mojo\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0

\fs32 \cf14 \
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0
\cf15 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0
\cf2 And you can start a REPL session by running 
\fs28 \cf10 \cb16 mojo
\fs32 \cf2 \cb1  with no commands.\
You can check your current version with 
\fs28 \cf10 \cb16 mojo --version
\fs32 \cf2 \cb1 . For version information, see the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://docs.modular.com/stable/mojo/changelog/"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \ul \ulc5 Mojo changelog}}.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa800\partightenfactor0

\fs64 \cf2 Commands\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0
{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://docs.modular.com/stable/mojo/cli/run/"}}{\fldrslt 
\fs28 \cf5 \cb16 \ul \ulc5 run}}
\fs32  \'97 Builds and executes a Mojo file.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0
{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://docs.modular.com/stable/mojo/cli/build/"}}{\fldrslt 
\fs28 \cf5 \cb16 \ul \ulc5 build}} \'97 Builds an executable from a Mojo file.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0
{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://docs.modular.com/stable/mojo/cli/repl/"}}{\fldrslt 
\fs28 \cf5 \cb16 \ul \ulc5 repl}} \'97 Launches the Mojo REPL.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0
{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://docs.modular.com/stable/mojo/cli/debug/"}}{\fldrslt 
\fs28 \cf5 \cb16 \ul \ulc5 debug}} \'97 Launches the Mojo debugger using the command-line interface or an external editor.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0
{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://docs.modular.com/stable/mojo/cli/package/"}}{\fldrslt 
\fs28 \cf5 \cb16 \ul \ulc5 package}} \'97 Compiles a Mojo package.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0
{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://docs.modular.com/stable/mojo/cli/format/"}}{\fldrslt 
\fs28 \cf5 \cb16 \ul \ulc5 format}} \'97 Formats Mojo source files.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0
{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://docs.modular.com/stable/mojo/cli/doc/"}}{\fldrslt 
\fs28 \cf5 \cb16 \ul \ulc5 doc}} \'97 Compiles docstrings from a Mojo file.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0
{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://docs.modular.com/stable/mojo/cli/demangle/"}}{\fldrslt 
\fs28 \cf5 \cb16 \ul \ulc5 demangle}} \'97 Demangles the given name.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa800\partightenfactor0

